{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國女星姬赫遜（Kate Hudson）是美國著名女星高蒂韓（Goldie Hawn）的女兒，其繼父卻羅素（Kurt Russell）亦是電影紅星。</p><p>姬近日就於社交網分享最近新片《逆轉狂籃》（Running Point）的拍攝花絮照片。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:15:08.910601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:08:32.082573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:08:32.082573+00:00","content_hash":"dae01acdabe51bccb88e84dc5181bd6775ee362638d6e456010c6995c479694f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}